    "text": "59 minutes ago CORRIGAN, Texas — A Corrigan-Camden High School athlete is being remembered after collapsing during a football game last month. Daniel Rivera, 17, a collapsed during a Corrigan-Camden football game and later died from a rare brain condition. His family now clings to their faith and the lasting joy he brought to their lives. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
